  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Zero-Build Hosting",
      "items": [
        "amplify.yml runs no build commands — Amplify publishes the site/ directory exactly as committed",
        "The CSP refuses every external origin, the same property the local dashboard holds",
        "Fonts are self-hosted woff2, cached immutable for a year"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Checks Before Push",
      "items": [
        "oxlint and the Playwright smoke + dashboard specs run in the local loop",
        "A .gitignore exception (!site/*.png) keeps og.png and board.png in the publish — without it Amplify would silently lose them"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Watch This Seam",
      "items": [
        "site/ has moved to React 19 + Vite 8, but the empty build phase still ships the raw directory",
        "Before the React portal ships, amplify.yml needs vite build and a dist/ artifact directory",
        "Until then, what Amplify serves is whatever site/ holds at the commit — not the Vite output"
      ]
    }
  ]
